[[File:Map040.png|center|350px]]
'''The Edge of Spacetime''' (時空の最果て, ''Jikū no Saihate'', '''Farthest Point of Spacetime''') is the 2nd sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 100th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Even with all the returning enemies, most of these stages are straightforward enough and provide minimal difficulty by late-game standards. The hardest stage is either [[Zero Horizon]] or [[Sunset Hadron]], while the easiest is [[Protons, Neutrons, and Morons]], a good stage for farming [[Ototo Corps|Materials Z]].
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 5 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[The Cat God]]: Making his first appearance in Legend Stages since his debut in [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]] in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1, The Cat God is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy with very high health, range and damage, which combined with his three-part attack makes him a serious threat.
*[[White Cyclone]]: A [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that originally debuted in [[Attack on W-Cyclone (Expert)|Peerless]], it possesses high health, extreme overall DPS but very low range and somewhat slow speed.
*[[Crustaceous Scissorex]]: An Alien/Behemoth enemy originally seen in [[Ashvini Desert]]. With Long Distance Multi-Hit attacks that reach up to 601, this enemy can take out backliners. It slows Cats for 3 seconds and is Immune to Waves.
*[[Hannya]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy introduced as the main threat of [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|River Styx]]. She has extreme range, health and damage, [[Weaken|Weakening]] Cats that survive her attacks to 25% for 5 seconds.
*[[Mini White Cyclone]]: The only brand new enemy is a weaker version of [[White Cyclone]] that drops a fair share of money, with even lower speed, Single Target attacks and slightly higher range.

