==Trivia==
*The map of all 8 [[Zero Legends]] sub-chapters from Edge of Spacetime through [[Garden of Wilted Thoughts]] is a jumbled up and mirrored map of Japan with real geographic features on it such as [[wikipedia:Mount Fuji|Mount Fuji]]. These 8 sub-chapters have a combined total of 48 stages, just like a [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapter]]; the 48th stage, [[Adherence to Virtue]], even has a unique [[Sage of Mind Soractes|boss]] and [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|reward]].
**These sub-chapters may specifically represent the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]] of [[Empire of Cats]], which takes place across the 47 prefectures of Japan and [[wikipedia:Iriomote Island|Iriomote Island]] rather than various countries and the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]].
*Most stages of this sub-chapter reference different concepts in physics.
**[[Zero Horizon]] may refer to an [[wikipedia:Event horizon|event horizon]].
**[[The Theory of Felinity]] references Einstein's [[wikipedia:Theory of relativity|theory of relativity]], a leading theory in theoretical physics along with [[wikipedia:Quantum mechanics|quantum mechanics]].
**[[Sunset Hadron]], [[Protons, Neutrons, and Morons]], and [[Neutrino Snowlands]] reference four types of particles (hadrons, protons, neutrons, and neutrinos).
*The Edge of Spacetime is the first main Legend Stages map to contain any non-Li'l [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s and [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]].

